WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.718 --> 00:00:07.199
This page connects the course to your own field of study, whatever you are here to become.

2
00:00:07.199 --> 00:00:16.102
Pick your area of study, or your exact program. General stream and Still exploring are real options and have their own write-ups.

3
00:00:16.102 --> 00:00:25.933
Read the lens first. The Read the course this way line gives you one question to carry through the whole course from your field's point of view.

4
00:00:25.933 --> 00:00:36.936
Work the systems and the scenario. Each field names the systems to watch, the artifacts that count as evidence, and a concrete picture of the course ideas operating in that world.

5
00:00:36.936 --> 00:00:45.599
Follow the week links. Each field points at the weeks that matter most for it, and those links jump straight to the stations.

6
00:00:45.599 --> 00:00:53.692
Write the reflection. One honest paragraph about how this course touches your field is a seed for assignments later.

7
00:00:53.692 --> 00:01:00.614
The graded curriculum is identical for every student. The lens changes examples and framing only.

8
00:01:00.614 --> 00:01:07.299
Where next: Visit a week the page recommends for your field and watch the framing follow you.
